title: Root Scene
new-page: true
go-to: post_event if started = 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true
go-to: start_menu_2

= title text

@start_menu_2

- @start_1: Start game
- @modinfo: Mod Info - Last Updated text
- @credits: Credits
- @game_over.achievements

@start_1
on-arrival: player_beg = 1 if not achievement_game_completed
go-to: start if achievement_game_completed; pls_player if not achievement_game_completed


@pls_player

Read.

- @modinfo.infotext: Mod Info - Last Updated text


